  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 20545933312
    m_Localized: Socket Node can store a {gem|Gem} while allocated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 246914488602624
    m_Localized: Increases chance to land an attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247052791582720
    m_Localized: Its hit chance is checked against defender {evasion|Evasion}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247115550953472
    m_Localized: Ailments are negative {effect|Effects} applied by hits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247175881822208
    m_Localized: '{ignite|Ignite}, {chill|Chill}, {overcharge|Overcharge} and {bleed|Bleed}
      are ailments'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247191832760320
    m_Localized: The base chance to inflict an Ailment is equal to the corresponding
      {damage|damage} dealt by the hit as a percentage of the target's Max Health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247264213864448
    m_Localized: Reduces incoming {physical|Physical} {damage|Damage}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247311684997120
    m_Localized: Barrier charges absorb {physical|physical} {damage|damage} before
      health is hit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247372057808896
    m_Localized: Any hit that is absorbed by a Barrier  breaks it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247384347119616
    m_Localized: Each charge absorbs {damage|damage} up to Barrier Capacity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247399215927296
    m_Localized: Remaining {damage|damage} beyond Barrier Capacity continues through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247474637901824
    m_Localized: Bleed is an {ailment|Ailment} caused by {physical|Physical} hits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247487862542336
    m_Localized: It stores 30% of dealt {physical|Physical} {damage|damage} as {damage|damage}
      over time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247495907217408
    m_Localized: Each Bleed stack is a separate effect, and deals its stored {damage|damage}
      evenly over 5 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247590371332096
    m_Localized: Block reduces {damage|damage} from a hit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247601490432000
    m_Localized: Block does not prevent {effect|Effects} from being applied
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247671870853120
    m_Localized: Chill is an {ailment|Ailment} caused by Cold hits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247686471225344
    m_Localized: It reduces Attack Speed by 20%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247699477762048
    m_Localized: Base Chill duration is 3 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15599070000000010
    m_Localized: Freeze replaces {chill|Chill} when a hit that applies {chill|Chill}
      also deals more than 40% of the target's Maximum Health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15599070000000012
    m_Localized: Frozen units cannot attack for 2 seconds, then receive {chill|Chill}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247765575798784
    m_Localized: A shared defensive stat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247782403346432
    m_Localized: It feeds {armor|Armor}, {evasion|Evasion}, {barrier|Barrier} power,
      and {block|Block} chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247885616779264
    m_Localized: Distract is an {effect|Effect} that can be applied to units
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247894802305024
    m_Localized: It reduces {accuracy|Accuracy} by 20%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247903375462400
    m_Localized: Distract lasts 5 seconds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247989987840000
    m_Localized: Effects can be applied to units
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248008887373824
    m_Localized: Effects include various negative effects, as well as {ailment|Ailments}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248071780962304
    m_Localized: Covers fire, cold, and lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248179712987136
    m_Localized: Gives attacks a chance to miss entirely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248190060335104
    m_Localized: Its dodge chance is checked against attacker {accuracy|Accuracy}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248299066101760
    m_Localized: Gems can be placed into {socketnode|Socket Nodes}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248313007968256
    m_Localized: Gem grants its effect only while placed in a {socketnode|Socket
      Node}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248348328202240
    m_Localized: Ignite is an {ailment|Ailment} caused by Fire hits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248365214470144
    m_Localized: It stores 30% of dealt Fire {damage|damage} in a single burning
