    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248374098006016
    m_Localized: Ignite {damage|damage} is dealt over time at 40% of the remaining
      stored {damage|damage} per second
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248452351135744
    m_Localized: Covers {light|Light} and {darkness|Darkness} {damage|damage}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248538325979136
    m_Localized: Overcharge is an {ailment|Ailment} caused by Lightning hits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248576729026560
    m_Localized: It empowers the next hit against the target with 10% more {damage|damage}
