  - m_Id: 46845600000000003
    m_Localized: Chance to parry a successfully blocked hit. With 50% Block Chance
      and 10% Parry Chance, 5% of incoming hits are parried. Each parry grants +30%
      attack progress, scaled by {parryPower|Parry Power}. Parrying preserves the
      normal damage reduction from Block.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
