    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46845600000000021
    m_Localized: Increases the attack progress granted by {parryChance|Parry}. Base
      gain is 30% of an attack cycle, multiplied by (1 + Parry Power). With +50%
      Parry Power, a parry grants 45% attack progress. The gain cannot be negative.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46845600000000029
